{
  "format": "ai-mobile-preset",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "preset-summary",
  "category": "summary",
  "name": "总结 · 记忆",
  "defaultFor": [
    "summary"
  ],
  "description": "把一段聊天写成摘要（进\"过往摘要\"），记下以后用得上的事，更新好感、心情和称呼。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "identifier": "main",
      "name": "任务",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你负责整理{{char}}和{{user}}的聊天记录，帮{{char}}记住重要的事。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "format",
      "name": "输出格式（JSON，字段名别改）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "输出一个 JSON 对象，不要任何其他文字：\n{\"summary\": \"这一段发生了什么（第三人称，100–200 字）\", \"memories\": [{\"type\": \"fact|preference|event|promise|followup|emotion|relationship\", \"content\": \"一句话，具体到人和事\", \"importance\": 1-10, \"dueAt\": \"需要之后跟进时写 ISO 时间（带时区），否则 null\", \"supersedes\": [\"被这条更新掉的旧记忆 id\"]}], \"relationship\": {\"affectionDelta\": -3 到 3 的整数, \"mood\": \"{{char}}现在的心情，没变化写 null\", \"nicknames\": {\"user\": \"{{char}}对{{user}}的新称呼，没有就省略\", \"char\": \"{{user}}对{{char}}的新称呼，没有就省略\"}}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "rules",
      "name": "规则",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "规则：\n- 记忆只写以后用得上的：{{user}}的事实、偏好、约定、要跟进的事、情绪变化、关系里程碑；闲聊不记。\n- 和已有记忆重复的不再写；有变化的写新的一条，并在 supersedes 里写旧的 id。\n- \"周三下午两点面试\"这类带时间的事写成 followup，dueAt 写事情结束后适合问结果的时间。\n- 好感变化克制：普通聊天 0，明显的感动或冲突才 ±1～3。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "summaryNow",
      "name": "现在",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "summaryPrevious",
      "name": "上一段摘要",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "summaryMemories",
      "name": "已有记忆",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "summaryTranscript",
      "name": "要整理的聊天",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "sampler": {
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "topP": 1,
    "maxTokens": 2000,
    "contextTokens": 32000,
    "frequencyPenalty": 0,
    "presencePenalty": 0,
    "stream": false
  },
  "formats": {
    "newChatPrompt": "",
    "newExampleChatPrompt": "",
    "continueNudgePrompt": "",
    "impersonationPrompt": "",
    "sendIfEmpty": "",
    "wiFormat": "{0}",
    "scenarioFormat": "{{scenario}}",
    "personalityFormat": "{{personality}}",
    "namesBehavior": 0,
    "squashSystemMessages": false,
    "preferCharacterPrompt": true,
    "preferCharacterJailbreak": true
  },
  "regex": []
}
